# devices/lynx/drivers/bluetooth/conf: the Pixel 7a's own Bluetooth driver (docs/porting/drivers.md).

driver LYNX_BT
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.lynx_bt.c
	requires BT_HOST
	help    the Pixel 7a Bluetooth: WCN6740 on the APM USI1 UART, started by lynxld (lynx_bt=1): the transport of
	help    whole H4 packets under BT_HOST, which is iOS's bluetoothd's side; vendor commands are kept from the chip
